      "typeVersion": 2.4,
      "position": [
        1328,
        112
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Workflow 2: Lead Stops Responding\n\n**Trigger:** Schedule (every 4 hours)\n\n**Steps:**\n1. Fetch leads with status=Open and no update in 24h\n2. Mark leads as \"Stale - Follow Up Needed\"\n3. Send follow-up SMS to lead\n4. Notify leasing manager for review",
